        {
          "name": "GET /event  SSE 事件流",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/event",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "event"
              ]
            },
            "description": "text/event-stream。Postman 新版支持 SSE：发送后切到 Response 的事件视图。\n本轮会看到：server.connected → model.resolved → session.status{busy} → engine.extension（引擎原生事件透传）\n→ message.part.updated… → run.usage → session.status{idle} → session.idle。\nserver.heartbeat 约每 15 秒一次。\nengine.extension 的 payload 形如 {namespace:'pi'|'acp', nativeType:'compaction_start'|…, payload:{…}}，\n这是各引擎自己的原生能力，网关只感知不改写。\n断线重连带 Last-Event-ID 头可以补齐缺口。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
